            <div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">Indexer included</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Free with every package, % shown.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div data-reveal class="tkw-card flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
            <span class="tkw-ic grid h-11 w-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary"><i class="ph-bold ph-eye text-xl"></i></span>
            <div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">No black box</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Full per-link report, real-time progress.</p></div>
          </div>
          <div data-reveal class="tkw-card flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
            <span class="tkw-ic grid h-11 w-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 text-primary"><i class="ph-bold ph-arrows-clockwise text-xl"></i></span>
            <div><h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">Dead-link replacement</h3><p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">If a link drops, we rebuild it free.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->
    <section id="faq" class="py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 lg:px-8">
        <div data-reveal class="text-center">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-primary">FAQ</span>
          <h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-4xl">Questions, answered</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10 space-y-3">
          <details data-reveal class="faq-item group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5" open>
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold">Is the Indexer really included free with every package?<i class="ph-bold ph-caret-down transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Yes — every Backlink package runs through our Indexer at no extra cost. Typical 2-week index rates: Entity 80–95%, Pyramid ~70%, Guest Post ~100%, PR ~100%. A link Google never indexes can't pass authority, so we index by default and show you the exact percentage.</p>
          </details>
          <details data-reveal class="faq-item group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold">Are the links safe / white-hat?<i class="ph-bold ph-caret-down transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">100% white-hat. We follow Google's guidelines, diversify anchors at safe ratios and build a natural profile across trusted platforms. No PBNs, no spam, no black-box tactics.</p>
          </details>
          <details data-reveal class="faq-item group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold">What DR / DA do the links have?<i class="ph-bold ph-caret-down transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">It depends on the package. Entity builds authoritative profiles and citations; Guest Post placements start at DR30+, DR40+ and DR50+; PR lands on international news outlets. Every live link's DR/DA is shown in your report.</p>
          </details>
          <details data-reveal class="faq-item group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold">How long until I see results?<i class="ph-bold ph-caret-down transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Links are delivered within each package's SLA (from ~10 days to 3–4 weeks). Ranking impact builds over the following weeks as links index and Google recalculates authority — backlinks compound over time.</p>
          </details>
          <details data-reveal class="faq-item group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold">What if a link goes down?<i class="ph-bold ph-caret-down transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Dead links are replaced for free. We QA every link before delivery and keep monitoring after — if one drops, we rebuild it at no charge.</p>
          </details>
          <details data-reveal class="faq-item group rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5">
            <summary class="flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold">Can I combine link types?<i class="ph-bold ph-caret-down transition group-open:rotate-180"></i></summary>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground">Absolutely — the most natural profiles mix Entity (foundation), Guest Post (topical authority) and a Pyramid boost on key URLs, with PR for credibility. Tell us your goal and we'll design a safe mix.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ============ CTA / CONTACT ============ -->
    <section id="contact" class="py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 text-center lg:px-8">
        <div data-reveal class="rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card p-10 shadow-lg shadow-foreground/5 lg:p-14">
          <span class="grid h-14 w-14 mx-auto place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow-lg shadow-primary/30"><i class="ph-bold ph-share-network text-2xl"></i></span>
          <h2 class="mt-6 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight md:text-4xl">Build links that actually count</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground">Leave your details and a specialist will recommend a safe link mix for your goal and budget — every link indexed and reported.</p>
          <form id="lead-form" class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-center" novalidate>
            <input type="hidden" id="lead-package" name="package" value="" />
            <input type="text" name="company" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" class="hidden" />
            <label for="cta-email" class="sr-only">Email or phone number</label>
            <input id="cta-email" name="contact" type="text" inputmode="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="Your email or phone number" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-border bg-background px-4 py-3 text-sm outline-none transition focus:border-primary focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20 sm:max-w-xs" />
            <button id="lead-submit" type="submit" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-primary px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-primary-foreground transition hover:-translate-y-px hover:bg-primary/90 active:scale-[0.98]">
              <span class="lead-spinner hidden h-4 w-4 animate-spin rounded-full border-2 border-white/40 border-t-white"></span>
              <span class="lead-submit-label">Get a link plan</span>
            </button>
          </form>
          <p id="lead-status" class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Or call our hotline <a href="tel:+14155550142" class="font-semibold text-primary hover:underline">+1 (415) 555-0142</a> for help right away.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <script is:inline>
(function () {
      var pkgField = document.getElementById('lead-package');
      var input = document.getElementById('cta-email');
      var status = document.getElementById('lead-status');
      var defaultStatus = status ? status.innerHTML : '';
      document.querySelectorAll('a[data-goi]').forEach(function (a) {
        a.addEventListener('click', function () {
          var name = a.getAttribute('data-goi');
          if (pkgField) pkgField.value = name;
          if (input) input.placeholder = 'Ask about: ' + name.split(' · ')[0];
          if (status) status.textContent = 'You’re interested in the "' + name + '" package. Leave your contact details!';
        });
      });
    })();
  </script>

  <script src="/app.js?v=8" is:inline></script>
  <script src="/effects.js?v=2" is:inline></script>
</BaseLayout>
